    <string name="addagent_troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="addagent_trouble_direct">1. On the control agent\'s computer, check Tailscale is connected and signed in to the same account as this phone.\n2. Check this phone\'s Tailscale app is on.\n3. Ask the control agent to run its health check again: curl -s -m 30 -H @$HOME/.config/bridgit/header %1$s/health\n4. A 401 means the key is wrong: paste the prompt again or rotate the key.\n5. A timeout means the network path is blocked: try the userspace option instead.</string>
    <string name="addagent_trouble_userspace">1. On the control agent\'s host, check tailscaled is running and signed in to the same account as this phone.\n2. Check this phone\'s Tailscale app is on.\n3. Check ~/bin/bridgit exists and is executable, and ~/.config/bridgit/env has BRIDGIT_HOST, BRIDGIT_PORT and BRIDGIT_KEY.\n4. Ask the control agent to run: ~/bin/bridgit GET /v1/health\n5. A 401 means the key is wrong: paste the prompt again or rotate the key.</string>
